<title>UK: Sanwa Business Credit sets $200 mln 5-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Sanwa Business Credit sets $200 mln 5-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Sanwa and Merrill.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SANWA BUSINESS CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> KEEPWELL   SANWA BANK LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +20 BP    PAY DATE    19.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.78     FULL FEES   17.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A-	  REOFFER    99.78</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7.5 BP    SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	NOT 144A</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
